/* Alternate Pin Functions (partial: PA, PB only).
 *
 * Alternative pin selections are provided with a numeric suffix like _1, _2,
 * etc. Board-specific logic should select a concrete variant in board.h:
 *
 *   #define GPIO_USART0_TX GPIO_USART0_TX_1
 *
 * The unsuffixed form will be added once a recommended default is chosen.
 * This initial H759 mapping covers ports A and B; other ports will extend
 * the numbering sequence without renumbering existing variants.
 */

